cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its data, please cite it as below."
title: "Eco-Cinema Observatory (species-on-screen)"
abstract: >-
  A doctrine-governed eco-cinema observatory: scroll-driven cinematic
  ecological places, a research/archive surface of attested ecological
  narratives, and Darwin Core interaction archives grounded in the GBIF
  backbone taxonomy and OBO Relations Ontology interaction terms. Code is
  licensed Apache-2.0; documentation, editorial prose, and Darwin Core data
  are licensed CC-BY-4.0 (see LICENSING.md).
type: software
# NOTE: author identity is recorded from the repository's git author handle.
